<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuelan markets closed for Easter holiday.</title>
<headline>Venezuelan markets closed for Easter holiday.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuelan financial markets and banks were closed Thursday and Friday for the Easter long weekend break. They will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
